# - Table 3 gives CHGNet-r2SCAN MP-r2SCAN errors as 0.017 (0.0159) eV/atom and 0.038 (0.0211) eV/A; the parenthesised values are not explained and the first values are encoded. Energy MAEs in eV/atom are converted to meV/atom. The MP-r2SCAN test set may overlap with the teachers' training data (Sec. 2.4).
# - The two without-ATR controls are described only as supervised and self-/supervised pretraining on the original labels followed by MP-r2SCAN fine-tuning; which is control 1 and which control 2 is not stated. The ATR-routed calibration predictions (Fig. 2c, d: 0.025 eV/atom, 0.079 eV/A) are a selection of teacher outputs, not a model, and are not encoded.
# - Router metrics (Tables 1, 2) and MD stability statistics (temperatures, maximum forces, minimum distances, Table 4) have no metric property in the schema. The ten candidate teacher models are not all named.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
